  "steps": [
    {
      "id": "s1",
      "text": "Whisk dry ingredients together in large bowl."
    },
    {
      "id": "s2",
      "text": "Mix wet ingredients in a separate bowl. Pour wet ingredients over dry ingredients and combine with a few quick strokes of the whisk, leaving the batter slightly lumpy."
    },
    {
      "id": "s3",
      "text": "Whish the egg whites until stiff but not dry. This works well with an electric mixer. Fold into batter until just blended. Buttermilk substitute: for 1 cup buttermilk, add 1 tbs lemon juice or white vinegar to a cup measure and fill the rest with milk."
    }
